<title>USA: U S West to issue $4 bln debt securities.</title>
<headline>U S West to issue $4 bln debt securities.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U S West Inc said Thursday it has filed a shelf registration for a public offering of up to $4 billion of debt securities.</p>
<p>The debt securities are to be offered over an extended period of time in connection with its acquisition of Continental Cablevision Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Proceeds are to be used to refinance short-term debt incurred by the deal, as well as for general corporate purposes, U S West said.</p>
</text>
